:590:    - The two markers are simulated in lockstep. In path mode they follow the original straight-ahead motion and strict alternating turn rule, repainting path cells by advancing through the template cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2615:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/12/code.py:809:    cycle_pool = palette[3:]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2616:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/12/code.py:810:    cycle_colors = random.sample(cycle_pool, k=n_blocks)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2617:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/12/code.py:861:        g[template_row : template_row + 2, bc : bc + 2] = cycle_colors[i]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2618:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/12/code.py:879:        g[r, 0] = cycle_colors[0]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2619:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/4/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D4/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2620:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/4/code.py:16:Design analysis for combo variant D2/2 + D4/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2621:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/25/code.py:311:    Extend each wall-partitioned region into a spiral stripe pattern whose color cycle is the reverse of the diagonal depth cue.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2622:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:29:      cycle: [outer_segment_color, owning_diamond_color]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2623:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:54:    The two dimensions interact directly: the fixed distance determines how much of the A/B cycle\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2624:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:59:    The length multiplier is fixed at 2 and the color cycle is fixed at length 2. That keeps the\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2625:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:88:    - Segment and diamond colors always differ, otherwise the cycle would collapse visually.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2626:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:181:def _ray_cycle_colors(outer_color: int, diamond_color: int) -> tuple[int, int]:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2627:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:262:            cycle = _ray_cycle_colors(ocol, dcol)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2628:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:272:                    out[rr, cc] = cycle[step % len(cycle)]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2629:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:455:    cycle = _ray_cycle_colors(outer_color, diamond_color)\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2630:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/6/code.py:457:        grid[r, c] = cycle[step % len(cycle)]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2631:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/28/code.py:21:#      spiral generated by a fixed turning cycle: go straight when possible, otherwise turn right, so the path\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2632:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b0280bc/6/code.py:13:# layouts, rejects any sample that still contains a cycle, then recolors the unique farthest\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2633:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/18/code.py:76:    这两个线索都来自可见的空间关系，不依赖颜色编号大小、组件扫描顺序等不可视因素。\\n/ho