/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/10/code.py:232:    - Paint surviving cells with `palette[(distance // 2) % len(palette)]`, so every palette entry lasts for two consecutive layers before the cycle advances.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2646:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/9/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D13/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2647:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/9/code.py:39:   - 原代码的 `sort(key=(row, col))` 假设题目规则就是位置顺序；D2/2 明确破坏了这一点，必须改成按距中心排序。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2648:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/21/code.py:318:    Key insight: The marker singletons still encode the color cycle, but now two spatial effects interact: irregular separator blobs distort the outer rings, and interior blocker patches cast directional shadows that stop some frame segments early.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2649:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D5/2\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2650:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:37:#       Standalone D2/2 idea: only depths 0 and 2 would be colored, once each.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2651:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:43:#       frames rather than part of an infinite modulo cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2656:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/5/code.py:34:#        cycle through [7,3,4]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2657:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/13/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D1/1+D2/2+D10/2\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2658:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/23/code.py:31:#        segment, legend order provides the actual palette cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2659:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/23/code.py:246:    - Recover the shortest repeating cycle of that legend segment and use it as the\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2660:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/23/code.py:254:    the ordered cycle, and both clues are required because vertical alignment is\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2661:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/28/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D10/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2662:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/28/code.py:12:Design analysis for combo D2/2 + D10/0\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2663:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/28/code.py:46:   - D2/2 引入新的假设：距离最好唯一，否则主规则不明显。solver 用 `(dist2, row, col)` 做稳定\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2665:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/22/code.py:29:#   first depth where the paired palette diverges from the original cycle.  This\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2666:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/22/code.py:39:#   the same \\\"two markers -> four-step paired cycle\\\" motif, the cross-region\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2667:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/22/code.py:158:    The global \\\"same marker count in every region\\\" constraint makes the pairing rule stable across the whole grid: each region presents the same two-marker template, so the output reveals that every marker generates a self-color ring followed by a partner-color ring instead of the original one-color-per-depth cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2668:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/3/code.py:2:# combo_spe