pe depending on the cycle phase.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5920:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/15/code.py:156:    - colors cycle Y, Y, G;\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5921:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:30:#    - This combo: keep the source-color semantics, but simplify the cycle to a\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5922:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:46:#    from both the original yellow/green logic and the D12-only three-cycle logic.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5923:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:50:#    - `Y = 4`, `G = 3`, and `cycle = [4,4,3]` no longer hold. They become\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5924:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:51:#      `source_color`, `partner_color`, and an alternating 2-cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5925:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:81:#    - The \\\"difference vs D12-only three-cycle\\\" metric assumes enough stripe depth\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5926:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:186:        elif mode == \\\"d12_three_cycle\\\":\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5927:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:293:    out_d12 = _apply_pattern(g, spec, bg, mode=\\\"d12_three_cycle\\\")\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5928:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:327:        \\\"delta_vs_d12_three_cycle\\\": int(np.sum(out_combo != out_d12)),\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5929:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/14/code.py:483:    if metrics[\\\"delta_vs_d12_three_cycle\\\"] < max(8, len(spec[\\\"span\\\"]) + 2):\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5930:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/20/code.py:229:    cycle = [int(YELLOW), int(YELLOW), int(GREEN)]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5931:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/20/code.py:237:        col = int(cycle[int(step) % 3])\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5932:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/20/code.py:264:    cycle = [int(YELLOW), int(YELLOW), int(GREEN)]\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5933:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/221dfab4/20/code.py:272:        col = int(cycle[int(step) % 3])\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5934:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/38007db0/2/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D4/2\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5935:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/65b59efc/26/code.py:31:#      left-right flip, column 2 stamps an up-down flip, and later columns repeat that 3-way cycle.\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5936:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/28/code.py:43:# - 两个控制量都来自同一个杯的几何, 不依赖颜色编号、扫描顺序或不可见元数据。\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5937:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/9/code.py:11:#     - Change the trajectory from a solid block or grouped blocks into a periodic cycle over those\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5938:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/9/code.py:13:#     - The cycle order is inferred from visible mouth position, not from color ids:\\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:5939:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/9/code.py:30:#       cycle order from position without relying on numeric color ids.\\n/home/lixi