set dashed anti-diagonal, then snap every\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13367:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:60:#    other dashed anti-diagonal to its start and span.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13368:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:64:#    - Reference selection assumes an odd number of unique anti-diagonal offsets; the generator uses 3 or 5\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13369:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:71:_DIR = (-1, 1)  # anti-diagonal, lower-left to upper-right\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13370:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:217:    assert used == non_bg, \"all colored cells must belong to anti-diagonal dashed segments\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13371:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:223:        assert s_sorted[i + 1] - s_sorted[i] >= 4, \"anti-diagonal offsets must be well separated\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13372:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:229:    Normalize stepped anti-diagonal dashed segments to the median-offset segment's start and span.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13373:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:233:    - Several single-color `/` anti-diagonal segments appear as dashed runs: one colored cell, one gap, then\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed397419310/5/codegen_prompts/2.codex.log:13374:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/30/code.py:238:    - Parse every colored object as a dashed anti-diagonal segment and order the segments by perpendicular\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code